WEBVTT

00:00:14.227 --> 00:00:19.733
<i>What's this feeling I have,</i>
<i>as if I'm looking forward to...</i>

00:00:19.733 --> 00:00:25.939
<i>... somebody firing off his</i>
<i>missiles and ending everything?</i>

00:00:25.939 --> 00:00:31.378
<i>Is it a bad thing, or is this normal?</i>

00:00:31.378 --> 00:00:37.884
<i>I can't figure it out on my</i>
<i>own, so somebody tell me!</i>

00:00:37.884 --> 00:00:43.490
<i>And that person I love has once again...</i>

00:00:43.490 --> 00:00:49.930
<i>... gone far away without anybody noticing.</i>

00:00:49.930 --> 00:00:56.103
<i>Where have my dreams gone since then?</i>

00:00:56.103 --> 00:01:01.775
<i>I could swear that they</i>
<i>were right here long ago.</i>

00:01:01.775 --> 00:01:07.814
<i>We had a love that set our hearts on fire.</i>

00:01:07.814 --> 00:01:20.784
<i>Let's take back that feeling we had back then!</i>

00:01:39.646 --> 00:01:41.681
This is our chance! Our chance!
Our chance! Our chance!

00:01:41.681 --> 00:01:43.083
Our chance!

00:01:43.083 --> 00:01:46.386
You in the high-speed ship! Heave to!

00:01:46.386 --> 00:01:48.149
Stop, will you?!

00:01:48.989 --> 00:01:51.625
Damn! These people are nuts!

00:01:51.625 --> 00:01:55.629
Come on, Kiyone! Don't you
think you're overdoing it a little?

00:01:55.629 --> 00:01:57.798
Just keep quiet and pilot the ship!

00:01:57.798 --> 00:01:59.533
Y-Yes, Ma'am.

00:01:59.533 --> 00:02:03.128
This is our chance!
Our big chance of a lifetime!

00:02:03.670 --> 00:02:05.238
Bent Cougar.

00:02:05.238 --> 00:02:08.942
A terrorist wanted on suspicion
of five counts of colony destruction

00:02:08.942 --> 00:02:11.411
and three counts of
destroying military stations!

00:02:11.411 --> 00:02:15.575
Somebody from the big
leagues just dropped into our laps!

00:02:18.418 --> 00:02:20.654
If we arrest Bent, it'll be a huge <i>coup!</i>

00:02:20.654 --> 00:02:22.923
We'll be transferred to headquarters for sure!

00:02:22.923 --> 00:02:26.326
I could even get back on track on
the elite course that I had given up on!

00:02:26.326 --> 00:02:31.992
And then the glory-filled life I've
only dreamed of will be waiting for me!

00:02:38.338 --> 00:02:41.330
Kiyone is getting crazier and crazier!

00:02:42.108 --> 00:02:43.598
Damn!

00:02:46.146 --> 00:02:51.585
Defensive shield is fully operational.
Ship hasn't been damaged at all.

00:02:51.585 --> 00:02:54.888
Damn, that guy's a wanted terrorist, all right!

00:02:54.888 --> 00:02:58.225
For the sake of galactic peace,
we can't let him get away with this!

00:02:58.225 --> 00:02:59.559
Transfer to headquarters!
Transfer to headquarters!

00:02:59.559 --> 00:03:00.994
Transfer to headquarters!

00:03:00.994 --> 00:03:03.830
Mihoshi! Don't let this
guy get away, no matter what!

00:03:03.830 --> 00:03:05.398
You got it!

00:03:05.398 --> 00:03:06.633
Transfer to headquarters!
Transfer to headquarters!

00:03:06.633 --> 00:03:08.201
Transfer to headquarters!

00:03:08.201 --> 00:03:11.271
Making into one the power
of two people, let's do the...

00:03:11.271 --> 00:03:13.466
- Togetherness Kick of Justice!
- Togetherness Kick of Justice!

00:03:15.976 --> 00:03:18.345
Heave to, I said!

00:03:18.345 --> 00:03:19.913
Heave to!

00:03:19.913 --> 00:03:21.938
Damn flies...

00:03:23.316 --> 00:03:28.822
You ladies got guts, following
me in on a high-angle reentry...

00:03:28.822 --> 00:03:31.291
Anyway, what the hell's goin' on here?

00:03:31.291 --> 00:03:34.419
How come I dropped out of
warp out here in the boonies?

00:03:36.396 --> 00:03:38.131
Wh-What the...?

00:03:38.131 --> 00:03:40.867
- A tractor beam?!
- Don't resist!

00:03:40.867 --> 00:03:43.069
Stop this useless resistance of yours!

00:03:43.069 --> 00:03:45.105
Mihoshi! Ventral thrusters to full!

00:03:45.105 --> 00:03:47.307
Stop him from making reentry!

00:03:47.307 --> 00:03:49.400
Just leave it to me!

00:03:52.479 --> 00:03:54.080
You can do it, Mihoshi!

00:03:54.080 --> 00:03:56.241
Damn!

00:03:59.986 --> 00:04:03.888
I thought I told you to
give up this useless resistance!

00:04:06.059 --> 00:04:08.328
All right. I surrender.

00:04:08.328 --> 00:04:09.596
That's better.

00:04:09.596 --> 00:04:12.832
Bent Cougar, I place you
under arrest on suspicion of

00:04:12.832 --> 00:04:15.835
articles 26 and 52 of
the Galactic Unified Law!

00:04:15.835 --> 00:04:17.771
We'll be transferred
to headquarters for sure!

00:04:17.771 --> 00:04:21.608
We did it! We really did it, Kiyone!

00:04:21.608 --> 00:04:23.476
What a <i>coup!</i>

00:04:23.476 --> 00:04:27.003
Yay!

00:04:28.648 --> 00:04:30.411
- Then again...
- Then again...

00:04:38.792 --> 00:04:44.297
Nothing beats a clay
stove for grilling fish, huh?

00:04:44.297 --> 00:04:51.271
Darn it, it still smells burned!
I've washed it six times since yesterday!

00:04:51.271 --> 00:04:57.642
Now look here... Whose fault is it
that we almost got barbecued, huh?

00:04:59.012 --> 00:04:59.879
Whose?

00:04:59.879 --> 00:05:01.781
Now look here...

00:05:01.781 --> 00:05:05.218
Just be grateful we're alive!
We're still in one piece!

00:05:05.218 --> 00:05:07.821
I'm sorry!

00:05:07.821 --> 00:05:11.758
This is bad, huh, Ryo-Ohki?

00:05:11.758 --> 00:05:13.093
Oh, no!

00:05:13.093 --> 00:05:16.221
I cooked one for Washu again!

00:05:19.199 --> 00:05:24.938
She's been holed up in her lab lately,
so she says she doesn't need dinner.

00:05:24.938 --> 00:05:27.040
I wasted one again...

00:05:27.040 --> 00:05:30.844
I wonder if Ryoko's gonna come back soon?

00:05:30.844 --> 00:05:34.245
I wonder where Ryoko went?

00:05:46.893 --> 00:05:48.793
Okay, that's that.

00:05:50.730 --> 00:05:53.927
Geez, what a bunch of wimps.

00:05:56.236 --> 00:05:58.138
Hey, think you can do it?

00:05:58.138 --> 00:05:59.873
Give me a minute.

00:05:59.873 --> 00:06:05.045
I'm cutting the lines to the outside
and silencing all their security systems.

00:06:05.045 --> 00:06:07.180
I have to admit, you've got guts,

00:06:07.180 --> 00:06:11.584
hitting the Federal Bank's
main depository, of all places.

00:06:11.584 --> 00:06:16.690
I guess. This is our first job together,
so it should be memorable.

00:06:16.690 --> 00:06:18.992
When a magnificent team starts out,

00:06:18.992 --> 00:06:21.761
it should go after a worthy target.

00:06:21.761 --> 00:06:23.251
Right?

00:06:28.134 --> 00:06:31.371
Okay, the security's off.

00:06:31.371 --> 00:06:35.175
Shall we away, Princess?

00:06:35.175 --> 00:06:36.910
I ain't no princess!

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:40.505
The only "princess" I know, I can't stand!

00:06:43.316 --> 00:06:45.552
Anyway, what's going on around here?

00:06:45.552 --> 00:06:50.724
I know it's late, but isn't it kinda
unnatural for the place to be empty?

00:06:50.724 --> 00:06:54.194
They can't work
overtime even if they want to.

00:06:54.194 --> 00:06:56.162
You'll see if you step outside.

00:06:56.162 --> 00:06:59.063
I wouldn't recommend it, though.

00:07:03.269 --> 00:07:04.793
You okay?

00:07:06.639 --> 00:07:09.609
What's the deal? I couldn't breathe!

00:07:09.609 --> 00:07:12.412
Of course not. There's no oxygen.

00:07:12.412 --> 00:07:14.280
Why didn't you say so?!

00:07:14.280 --> 00:07:16.916
After business hours,
unnecessary oxygen is removed

00:07:16.916 --> 00:07:19.686
as a security measure, among other things.

00:07:19.686 --> 00:07:24.123
Oh, I get it... So it's not
gonna be as easy as I thought.

00:07:31.898 --> 00:07:35.201
Our current location is here.

00:07:35.201 --> 00:07:37.036
The depository is down this hall.

00:07:37.036 --> 00:07:40.273
Heck, it's a piece of cake, then!
All I have to do is teleport and...

00:07:40.273 --> 00:07:43.009
There's something up there, isn't there?

00:07:43.009 --> 00:07:44.677
That's right.

00:07:44.677 --> 00:07:47.480
From here on, the security's active.

00:07:47.480 --> 00:07:50.850
If you fly down there, you'll
be trapped by a force field

00:07:50.850 --> 00:07:52.886
and <i>bam!</i> The end.

00:07:52.886 --> 00:07:55.021
You'll be flash-fried.

00:07:55.021 --> 00:07:59.893
H-Hey, wait a minute! I thought you
turned off all the security systems!

00:07:59.893 --> 00:08:03.329
I did. But the systems down
here are a different story.

00:08:03.329 --> 00:08:07.534
In case of intruders, the depository's
security system is independent.

00:08:07.534 --> 00:08:09.869
It's impossible to manipulate
the systems from here.

00:08:09.869 --> 00:08:14.741
Oh... So the Feds aren't total idiots
when it comes to the Federal Bank.

00:08:14.741 --> 00:08:17.644
Something like that.

00:08:17.644 --> 00:08:19.045
Be careful, Ryoko.

00:08:19.045 --> 00:08:21.815
You may be a pirate, but
if those sensors pick you up,

00:08:21.815 --> 00:08:24.484
the Galaxy Police will come
down on you like a ton of bricks.

00:08:24.484 --> 00:08:27.487
I don't need to be told that!

00:08:27.487 --> 00:08:29.522
Who do you think you're talking to?!

00:08:29.522 --> 00:08:35.461
I'm Ryoko, the space pirate whose
name is feared across the galaxy!

00:08:35.461 --> 00:08:38.259
Oh. You're right.

00:08:39.098 --> 00:08:40.998
Let's get going.

00:08:47.340 --> 00:08:50.605
This security setup's pretty crude, isn't it?

00:08:57.217 --> 00:09:00.053
Don't underestimate Ryoko the space pirate!

00:09:00.053 --> 00:09:05.081
From here on is where it gets tricky.
This is the block with the depository.

00:09:07.927 --> 00:09:09.529
Oh, okay...

00:09:09.529 --> 00:09:11.431
You open it with this, huh?

00:09:11.431 --> 00:09:12.765
Let's see...

00:09:12.765 --> 00:09:13.666
Let me handle it.

00:09:13.666 --> 00:09:15.969
Hey, just leave it to me!

00:09:15.969 --> 00:09:19.739
You just do this down here,
and this over here...

00:09:19.739 --> 00:09:23.576
And then you do this, and then this! Easy!

00:09:23.576 --> 00:09:28.815
Huh? Then how about
here, and attaching this?

00:09:28.815 --> 00:09:32.719
Damn! Then how about this and this?!

00:09:32.719 --> 00:09:35.321
What's this thing's problem?!

00:09:35.321 --> 00:09:38.725
Damn it! Stop making a fool of me!

00:09:38.725 --> 00:09:40.894
Game over.

00:09:40.894 --> 00:09:42.896
Say what?!

00:09:42.896 --> 00:09:48.198
All right, you stupid machine!
You asked for it!

00:09:50.970 --> 00:09:53.495
Oh. Um...

00:09:56.175 --> 00:10:00.413
Well, if you really wanna
do it, I'll let you. Just this once.

00:10:00.413 --> 00:10:04.406
Oh, my. The Princess
does honor me too much.

00:10:11.190 --> 00:10:14.027
I can't believe you opened it that easily...

00:10:14.027 --> 00:10:16.696
Well, shall we go?

00:10:16.696 --> 00:10:18.129
Ryoko?

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:22.392
Right.

00:10:31.077 --> 00:10:35.615
You seem to be doing well, Hotsuma.

00:10:35.615 --> 00:10:37.183
Just a little more...

00:10:37.183 --> 00:10:38.818
A little more!

00:10:38.818 --> 00:10:45.558
When their bond is totally
shattered, my wish will come true!

00:10:45.558 --> 00:10:48.356
The Earth will be mine!

00:11:11.117 --> 00:11:15.254
Man, this burglary stuff is such a pain...

00:11:15.254 --> 00:11:16.889
My shoulders are all tense!

00:11:16.889 --> 00:11:19.292
I guess blasting my way in and
taking what I want is more my style

00:11:19.292 --> 00:11:21.694
than sneaking around like this.

00:11:21.694 --> 00:11:23.696
Don't talk like that, Ryoko.

00:11:23.696 --> 00:11:27.928
Sometimes you can't get what you're
after when you do things the pirate way.

00:11:31.537 --> 00:11:33.139
Okay, it's about to open.

00:11:33.139 --> 00:11:35.073
Okay.

00:11:40.680 --> 00:11:43.016
It ain't opening!

00:11:43.016 --> 00:11:47.186
This is a Galactic Federal
Bank security hologram.

00:11:47.186 --> 00:11:51.024
In order to open this depository,
your authorization code is necessary.

00:11:51.024 --> 00:11:55.120
So, what's your code?!

00:11:57.463 --> 00:12:01.267
In order to open this depository,
your authorization code is necessary.

00:12:01.267 --> 00:12:05.204
So, what's your code?!

00:12:05.204 --> 00:12:08.674
My code is...

00:12:08.674 --> 00:12:12.412
Stop spouting that crap
and open this stupid gate!

00:12:12.412 --> 00:12:15.415
I'd like to help you, but
you have to enter your code...

00:12:15.415 --> 00:12:18.084
Shove it! Just open the stupid thing!

00:12:18.084 --> 00:12:20.787
You can open it whenever you
like if you'd just input your code...

00:12:20.787 --> 00:12:23.389
Who wants to deal with
boring procedures like that?!

00:12:23.389 --> 00:12:24.757
Open it! Open it!

00:12:24.757 --> 00:12:26.952
Open it, I said!

00:12:28.227 --> 00:12:32.098
Come on, be a good boy and open it.

00:12:32.098 --> 00:12:33.399
Authorization code verified.

00:12:33.399 --> 00:12:36.069
Strong slaps. Left, right, left, right, left.

00:12:36.069 --> 00:12:38.805
Come on, be a good boy and open it.

00:12:38.805 --> 00:12:41.007
Weak slaps. Right, right, right.

00:12:41.007 --> 00:12:46.104
Final depository gate
locks released. Now opening.

00:12:50.883 --> 00:12:54.512
Wow, this is something else.
That's Galaxy Federal for you...

00:12:57.056 --> 00:12:58.958
That's a depository?

00:12:58.958 --> 00:13:00.960
Yeah. That's right.

00:13:00.960 --> 00:13:03.895
But... But isn't that?

00:13:07.166 --> 00:13:09.102
Isn't that a black hole?

00:13:09.102 --> 00:13:14.707
That it is. An extremely
powerful micro black hole.

00:13:14.707 --> 00:13:16.576
A micro black hole?

00:13:16.576 --> 00:13:19.145
An artificially created black hole.

00:13:19.145 --> 00:13:21.614
It's nothing compared to a real one,

00:13:21.614 --> 00:13:24.484
but if you use the latest
super-large scale gravity devices,

00:13:24.484 --> 00:13:27.720
I hear you can make
one with 30% of its output.

00:13:27.720 --> 00:13:31.491
I heard somewhere that a micro
black hole had been perfected,

00:13:31.491 --> 00:13:35.728
but for them to use a
black hole as a depository...

00:13:35.728 --> 00:13:38.498
Galaxy Federal's something else.

00:13:38.498 --> 00:13:41.667
They don't mess around!

00:13:41.667 --> 00:13:44.937
So how do you plan to steal this thing?

00:13:44.937 --> 00:13:49.041
Exactly. It's not that easy
to steal something like this.

00:13:49.041 --> 00:13:53.613
I realize that this isn't something
that you can just waltz out of here with.

00:13:53.613 --> 00:13:56.309
That's what makes it fun, don't you think?

00:14:02.722 --> 00:14:04.019
Look out!

00:14:06.125 --> 00:14:07.888
What the...?

00:14:12.265 --> 00:14:14.200
G-Guardians?!

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:18.638
But my beams just went wide!
They're able to deflect an attack?

00:14:18.638 --> 00:14:21.941
It's because of the micro
black hole's gravity field...

00:14:21.941 --> 00:14:24.967
Are you okay, Hotsuma? Hotsuma!

00:14:26.479 --> 00:14:28.709
R-Ryoko...

00:14:29.415 --> 00:14:32.179
You finally called me by my name...

00:14:38.357 --> 00:14:41.460
You idiot, what did you go and do that for?

00:14:41.460 --> 00:14:44.263
Who asked you to help me?

00:14:44.263 --> 00:14:48.201
What are you talking about? I had to.

00:14:48.201 --> 00:14:51.637
You're my partner, after all.

00:14:59.178 --> 00:15:01.047
Buy me some time.

00:15:01.047 --> 00:15:02.081
Hotsuma!

00:15:02.081 --> 00:15:05.318
Just one minute.
I'll be done in one minute.

00:15:05.318 --> 00:15:08.354
That's the black hole control booth.

00:15:08.354 --> 00:15:12.892
I'll release the loading exit joint
to get it ready for us to take it out.

00:15:12.892 --> 00:15:16.395
While I'm doing that, you
draw off the cannon fodder.

00:15:16.395 --> 00:15:18.030
Buy me some time!

00:15:18.030 --> 00:15:20.089
B-But...

00:15:23.603 --> 00:15:29.132
This is our first job. We can't
leave empty-handed, now can we?

00:15:32.478 --> 00:15:35.572
I'm counting on you, partner!

00:15:55.268 --> 00:16:00.103
Okay, pipsqueaks,
I'm gonna have me some fun!

00:16:05.011 --> 00:16:05.711
Pathetic!

00:16:05.711 --> 00:16:08.043
You're pathetic!

00:16:11.017 --> 00:16:15.545
Don't mess with Ryoko the space pirate!

00:16:28.601 --> 00:16:30.967
You're just a bunch of stupid robots!

00:16:34.006 --> 00:16:36.497
You think you can take me on?!

00:16:40.813 --> 00:16:44.010
You're way outta your league!

00:16:48.921 --> 00:16:53.017
Okay, bastards! Come get some!

00:16:58.531 --> 00:17:00.829
Gai'en!

00:17:01.634 --> 00:17:03.402
Yes, Sir!

00:17:03.402 --> 00:17:05.336
Let's go, Ryoko!

00:17:09.041 --> 00:17:10.643
Wh-What was that?!

00:17:10.643 --> 00:17:14.814
Fleet approaching from 8 o'clock.
They appear to be Galaxy Police.

00:17:14.814 --> 00:17:16.649
They came sooner than I thought...

00:17:16.649 --> 00:17:21.454
This is the Galaxy Police!
Unidentified vessel, heave to!

00:17:21.454 --> 00:17:23.786
I repeat, heave to!

00:17:25.057 --> 00:17:27.048
- Get us out of here, Gai'en!
- Roger!

00:17:33.032 --> 00:17:35.899
Damn! The micro black hole!

00:17:41.507 --> 00:17:45.945
Well, damn... All that effort,
and nothing to show for it.

00:17:45.945 --> 00:17:49.348
No, I helped myself to a little of this.

00:17:49.348 --> 00:17:51.839
They look like Juraian bills.

00:17:55.221 --> 00:17:57.212
Like I need this garbage!

00:18:00.059 --> 00:18:02.361
Anyway, Hotsuma...

00:18:02.361 --> 00:18:05.064
I haven't felt a rush
like that in a long time...

00:18:05.064 --> 00:18:08.968
It's dangerous, being a pirate...

00:18:08.968 --> 00:18:12.267
It felt great to cut loose again!

00:18:13.506 --> 00:18:21.538
So I wasn't wrong. This is how
you were always meant to be, Ryoko.

00:18:24.683 --> 00:18:26.986
How's your arm?

00:18:26.986 --> 00:18:29.511
It's all right. It's just a scratch.

00:18:32.892 --> 00:18:34.484
Ryoko...

00:18:35.795 --> 00:18:38.297
Do I pass?

00:18:38.297 --> 00:18:40.599
As your partner, I mean.

00:18:40.599 --> 00:18:42.294
I suppose.

00:18:49.375 --> 00:18:51.811
We did it! We did it!

00:18:51.811 --> 00:18:54.146
We did it!!

00:18:54.146 --> 00:18:55.414
You've been promoted?

00:18:55.414 --> 00:18:56.849
That's right!

00:18:56.849 --> 00:18:59.051
We were just contacted by headquarters,

00:18:59.051 --> 00:19:01.454
but we arrested that wanted criminal, right?

00:19:01.454 --> 00:19:04.390
In recognition of that,
they've naturally promoted us

00:19:04.390 --> 00:19:06.459
from Detectives First Grade
to Detectives Special Grade!

00:19:06.459 --> 00:19:09.762
Wow! That's amazing, Kiyone, Mihoshi!

00:19:09.762 --> 00:19:11.530
Congratulations, the both of you.

00:19:11.530 --> 00:19:16.469
Thank you! But that's not all!
There's more! There's more!

00:19:16.469 --> 00:19:20.473
We've been transferred
to Galaxy Police station 62,

00:19:20.473 --> 00:19:25.878
which has just been constructed on Pluto!

00:19:25.878 --> 00:19:28.047
Wait, you're not gonna...

00:19:28.047 --> 00:19:29.849
No, it can't be!

00:19:29.849 --> 00:19:32.885
Kiyone, can't you do something?! Please!

00:19:32.885 --> 00:19:37.223
We'll miss all of you when we leave,
of course, but it can't be helped.

00:19:37.223 --> 00:19:41.260
We're police officers, and we can't
disobey orders from headquarters.

00:19:41.260 --> 00:19:45.464
So, when will you leave
for this station, Kiyone?

00:19:45.464 --> 00:19:49.127
We have to report there today!

00:19:55.541 --> 00:20:00.308
I'm not here right now.
Leave a message after the beep.

00:20:01.480 --> 00:20:02.982
Was Tenchi there, Mihoshi?

00:20:02.982 --> 00:20:05.784
No, it looks like he's still out.

00:20:05.784 --> 00:20:09.255
Well, we can tell him
about our transfer later.

00:20:09.255 --> 00:20:11.416
Anyway, you'd better hurry and get ready!

00:20:11.991 --> 00:20:13.652
Right...

00:20:15.394 --> 00:20:17.263
These big ships are the only way to fly!

00:20:17.263 --> 00:20:21.734
Goodbye, everyone! Goodbye!

00:20:21.734 --> 00:20:26.364
Don't forget about us, okay?

00:20:32.878 --> 00:20:36.215
It certainly is quiet...

00:20:36.215 --> 00:20:40.019
Wow, Sasami's cooking can't be beat!

00:20:40.019 --> 00:20:43.389
This hard-boiled <i>kinmedai</i> is the greatest!

00:20:43.389 --> 00:20:48.224
- It looks great, and it tastes great,
and I can't get enough.
- Why... Why is this happening?

00:20:49.328 --> 00:20:50.462
Sister...

00:20:50.462 --> 00:20:58.028
We were all so close, and now
we've fallen apart in just a few months...

00:21:04.076 --> 00:21:07.170
Perhaps this is some sort
of sign of things to come...

00:21:36.108 --> 00:21:39.712
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:39.712 --> 00:21:43.616
<i>Sleeping late, staying up late,</i>
<i>and napping all the time!</i>

00:21:43.616 --> 00:21:47.219
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:47.219 --> 00:21:51.156
<i>Sneaking bites to eat, midnight</i>
<i>snacks, and pouring tea on my rice!</i>

00:21:51.156 --> 00:21:54.660
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:58.631
<i>Playing video games and singing karaoke!</i>

00:21:58.631 --> 00:22:01.967
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it...</i>

00:22:01.967 --> 00:22:05.971
<i>Lying in the sun and taking baths outside!</i>

00:22:05.971 --> 00:22:08.107
<i>- Taking side trips!</i>
<i>- Gossiping!</i>

00:22:08.107 --> 00:22:10.042
<i>- Taking long baths</i>
<i>- Wasting my money!</i>

00:22:10.042 --> 00:22:11.543
<i>- Being a busybody!</i>
<i>- Talking forever on the phone!</i>

00:22:11.543 --> 00:22:17.383
<i>- Unrequited love!</i>
<i>- Stealing other people's men!</i>

00:22:17.383 --> 00:22:21.487
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:21.487 --> 00:22:24.757
<i>no matter how old I get!</i>

00:22:24.757 --> 00:22:28.293
<i>I just can't stop it, I just can't stop it,</i>

00:22:28.293 --> 00:22:32.992
<i>even if I die, change shape, or get reborn!</i>

00:22:42.875 --> 00:22:45.210
Hi, Sasami here!

00:22:45.210 --> 00:22:47.246
Listen, Tenchi...

00:22:47.246 --> 00:22:51.183
The house used to be so
lively, and now it's lonely here!

00:22:51.183 --> 00:22:55.754
Is it really because Ryoko,
Mihoshi and Kiyone are gone?

00:22:55.754 --> 00:23:01.226
Ayeka is acting kind of funny,
and if we don't do something, we'll...

00:23:01.226 --> 00:23:03.929
What should we do, Tenchi?

00:23:03.929 --> 00:23:10.493
Next time on <i>Tenchi in Tokyo:</i>
"The Lonely Princess."
